Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.53,0:00:00.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.80,0:00:01.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,I want to show you something
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.60,0:00:02.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,I've been working on.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.80,0:00:05.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's an interactive Koi Fish wallpaper.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.40,0:00:10.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Just click anywhere on the water
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.70,0:00:12.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,to drop some fish food,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.29,0:00:13.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,and watch the koi swim towards
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.77,0:00:15.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,it and start eating.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.12,0:00:16.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,If the food lands on a
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.13,0:00:17.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,lotus leaf,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.36,0:00:19.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,the leaves actually move and react
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.79,0:00:20.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,to it.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.57,0:00:21.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,I've also added a lot of
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.78,0:00:23.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,little details to make the pond
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.40,0:00:24.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,feel alive:
Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.68,0:00:26.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,realistic water ripples,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.21,0:00:27.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,tiny air bubbles,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.59,0:00:29.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,soft shadows from the lotus flowers,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.71,0:00:30.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,and much more.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.87,0:00:33.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,You can customize the experience, too.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.26,0:00:34.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Change the number of fish in
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.40,0:00:35.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,the pond,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:35.33,0:00:36.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,adjust the frame rate up to
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.56,0:00:38.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,144 FPS,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.53,0:00:40.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,and choose the rendering quality,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.17,0:00:41.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,from low all the way up
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.21,0:00:42.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,to Ultra.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.29,0:00:43.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,But this is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.17,0:00:45.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of adding a day-and-night
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.70,0:00:46.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,cycle,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.50,0:00:48.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,so you can experience the pond
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.04,0:00:49.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,under moonlight,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.03,0:00:50.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,along with a rainy weather effect,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.88,0:00:53.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,where raindrops create ripples across
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.04,0:00:53.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,the water.
